<title>USA: Sears opens national customer service center.</title>
<headline>Sears opens national customer service center.</headline>
<dateline>HOFFMAN ESTATES, Ill. 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sears, Roebuck and Co said Tuesday it opened a national customer relations center in Greensboro, N.C., which will handle all customer queries on the Sears Home Improvements operation.</p>
<p>The center will answer customer questions on roofing, siding, replacement windows and doors, kitchen and bath remodeling, pest control and other services, Sears said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
